  "statement": "Security wants to know whether a badge label reads the same forwards and\nbackwards once you ignore everything that is not a letter or a digit and stop\ncaring about case.\n\nReturn `true` when the label is a palindrome under those rules. A label with no\nletters or digits at all counts as one.\n\n**Example 1**\n\n`is_badge_palindrome(\"A man, a plan, a canal: Panama\")` returns `true`: the\nletters alone read `amanaplanacanalpanama`.\n\n**Example 2**\n\n`is_badge_palindrome(\"badge-42\")` returns `false`.\n\n**Constraints**\n\n- `0 <= badge.length <= 20000`\n- The label holds printable ASCII only.\n",
  "guidelines": "Two pointers walking inward, skipping punctuation, is the clean answer. Building the filtered string first is fine too. Watch for case folding and for the empty label, which is a palindrome.",
  "test_cases": [
    {"name":"the canal","class":"sample","args":["A man, a plan, a canal: Panama"],"returns":true,"visibility":"public","weight":1},
    {"name":"a plain badge","class":"sample","args":["badge-42"],"returns":false,"visibility":"public","weight":1},
    {"name":"nothing to compare","class":"edge","args":[""],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"punctuation only","class":"edge","args":["?!, ;"],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"a digit and a letter","class":"edge","args":["0P"],"returns":false,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"the car and the cat","class":"core","args":["Was it a car or a cat I saw?"],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"no lemon","class":"core","args":["No lemon, no melon!"],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"mixed digits","class":"core","args":["1a2 b2A1"],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"nearly a palindrome","class":"core","args":["Race carts"],"returns":false,"visibility":"hidden","weight":1},
    {"name":"twenty thousand characters","class":"perf","args":[""],"returns":true,"visibility":"hidden","weight":2},
    {"name":"twenty thousand, off by one","class":"perf","args":[""],"returns":false,"visibility":"hidden","weight":2}
  ]
}
